# urllib3 2.7.0, same as above - bundled inside pip's own vendored copy, not
# site-packages. A requirements.txt pin to >=2.8.0 installs cleanly but
# doesn't touch pip's vendored copy, so Trivy keeps flagging 2.7.0. Recheck
# after the next python:3.13-slim bump ships a pip with urllib3>=2.8.0.
